.</span></p><p>Molmo streamlines the training process by avoiding multiple =
pretraining stages, choosing instead a simple pipeline that updates all par=
ameters in a unified approach=E2=80=94including those of the base LLM, the =
connector, and the image encoder.</p><p>The Molmo team offers several optio=
ns for the base LLM:</p><ul><li><p>OLMo-7B-1024 (a fully open model backbon=
e),</p></li><li><p>OLMoE-1B-7B (a mixture-of-experts architecture; the most=
 efficient model),</p></li><li><p>Qwen2 7B (an open-weight model that perfo=
rms better than OLMo-7B-1024),</p></li><li><p>Qwen2 72B (an open-weight mod=
el and the best-performing model)</p></li></ul><p></p><h2 class=3D"header-a=
nchor-post"><strong>4.3 NVLM: Open Frontier-Class Multimodal LLMs</strong><=
